## Interface: 11509
## Title: |cffFF8000Lib: QuestDB|r |cff999999Vanilla|r
## Notes: Standalone offline quest database for the TOG suite: quest rewards (items, choices, money, reputation, spells) without the quest being in your log. Fills the gap Questie leaves.
## Author: Pimptasty
## Version: QuestDB-v0.1.0
## Category: Library
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1700352
## DefaultState: enabled
## OptionalDeps: Questie

libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua

LibQuestDB-1.0.lua

# Locale-independent reward rows for this expansion, generated by tools/build-rewards.py from the
# CMaNGOS world database. Every Data file resolves the library through LibStub, so the library
# loads first. Locales.lua declares which text locales ship -- a manifest, not a gate -- and stays
# ahead of every Text.lua so lib:GetShippedLocales is answerable before any text arrives.
Data\Vanilla\_core\Rewards.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\Quests.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\Coverage.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\QuestXP.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\NPCs.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\Objects.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\NPCSpawns.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\ObjectSpawns.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\Drops.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\Zones.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\Paths.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\Approaches.lua
Data\Vanilla\_core\Locales.lua

# Quest, NPC, object and quest-sort text, one file each per locale (tools/build-text.py,
# tools/build-npcs.py, tools/build-zones.py). Each self-selects through lib:WantsLocale(). ENGLISH
# ALWAYS LOADS and a translation is laid over it FIELD BY FIELD (MINOR 16), so a locale file listed
# after these fills in what it has and leaves the rest in English.
Data\Vanilla\enUS\Text.lua
Data\Vanilla\enUS\NPCText.lua
Data\Vanilla\enUS\ObjectText.lua
Data\Vanilla\enUS\SortText.lua

# LAST, and after every Data file: the optional Questie source (MINOR 12). Questie's curated rows
# answer where Questie is installed and the data above is the fallback where it is not, which is
# the operator's directive of 2026-09-22. It reads the shipped rows for the counts Questie does
# not carry, so it must load after them; with Questie absent it registers nothing.
QuestieSource.lua
